## Part 3: Busy Observation Period

The busiest range was from September 25 to September 30th this year. Basic explanations could be new students arriving in the fall and nice weather before it started to get colder. After some online searching, I also found an iNaturalist event called BIOL-1001 BIOBLITZ (Fall 2026). Students from this intro biology class collect and contribute iNaturalist observations in mid to late september. The overview of the project claims over 2,000 observations from Sep 15 to Sep 30.

Source: [iNaturalist](https://www.inaturalist.org/projects/biol-1001-bioblitz-fall-2026)

